      "message": "Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/main' into issue/1873-cadmpeg-runner\n\nConflicted files:\n- crates/app/src/commands/import_model.rs (ImportModel::within): hand\n  resolved. Main (#2689) replaced the two-read digest with the one-read\n  load_model_open_sourced; this branch routed qualified native files to\n  the cadmpeg converter. Kept both: the Converted route returns first\n  (load_model_open_sourced cannot read a native extension), with the\n  #2463 two-read digest because the converter reads the file itself;\n  every other file takes main's one-read sourced path (wasm: main's\n  load_model_open_within).\n\nRefs #1873\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
